## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Character not showing?
- Check if character data exists: `console.log(character)`
- Verify model URL is valid
- Check network connectivity

### Corner widget not visible?
- Ensure `zIndex: 1000` in styles
- Check if character object exists
- Verify position styles (bottom, left)

### TTS not working?
- Check device volume
- Test on physical device (not simulator)
- Verify expo-speech installation

